<title>ARGENTINA: Bansud Q4 net rose to $10.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Bansud Q4 net rose to $10.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr n/a</p>
<p>Net $10.1 million vs $4.2 million</p>
<p>Net assets $3.12 billion vs $2.18 billion</p>
<p>Note: The Argentine bank said its loans outstanding rose to $2.22 billion at December 31 vs $1.60 billion at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>((Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618)</p>
